# Desires of Emptiness with a party (battlefield.desires_of_emptiness#helper). Main (5-2 at Status 2) and eve (5-3
# current: 5-2 done) in a party: both enter area 1; the Agonizers dead: WON, 32001 to both; main's handler (Status 3,
# set down in Beaucedine Glacier); eve's: nothing (not on the mission).
lists SpireOfVahzl/_0n0/onTrigger SpireOfVahzl/onEventUpdate/32000 SpireOfVahzl/onEventFinish/32000 SpireOfVahzl/onEventFinish/32001
char zone=SpireOfVahzl pos=0,0,0 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
char eve zone=SpireOfVahzl pos=0,0,0 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
mission Cop DesiresOfEmptiness current
charvar Mission[6][518]Status 2
eve: mission Cop ThreePaths current
login
eve: login
invite eve
eve: accept
trigger _0n0
update 32000 option=1
finish
eve: trigger _0n0
eve: update 32000 option=1
eve: finish
tick 2000
kill AGONIZER
kill AGONIZER+1
kill AGONIZER+6                         # WON: 32001 to both
finish
eve: finish
tick 11000
tick 10000
